[66],{"_62":63,"_25":67},"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Jack-c3l2w/arkanoid-neon/main/screenshots/gameplay.png","text","mediaReviewed","截图来源核查","value","2026-10-20","language","en","image","gameplay","The creator’s full portrait brick-breaker screenshot, preserved with side padding.","src","/GameMap/media/learning/arkanoid-neon-claude.webp","alt","A neon brick-breaker field with rainbow rows of bricks, a glowing ball and paddle, score and round indicators.","https://github.com/Jack-c3l2w/arkanoid-neon#readme","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","Creator-published screenshot","list","attribution","创作者记录中的客户端与模型",[93],"Claude Code","相关资源",[98],"resourceIds","section",{"_62":93,"_25":99},"/zh/resources/claude-code/","创作者开发记录",[103],"evidence",{"_62":104,"_25":82,"_105":106},"查看作者的 Claude Code 使用说明","note","The creator directly names Claude Code and its model, separates the original request from the finished project, and describes code-generated art/audio. Source-checked; full reproduction not performed.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[111],{"_62":112,"_25":113,"_105":114},"查看完整浏览器游戏","https://github.com/Jack-c3l2w/arkanoid-neon","Complete index.html, style.css and game.js with procedural graphics and audio; open index.html locally, no build step. Google Fonts is optional and falls back to system fonts offline. No root LICENSE was found. Fan project inspired by Arkanoid, not affiliated with Taito.","获取方式","playable","demo","试玩与运行",[120],{"_62":121,"_25":122,"_105":123},"Play Arkanoid Neon","https://jack-c3l2w.github.io/arkanoid-neon/","Mouse, arrows or A/D move; click/Space launches and fires; P/Esc pauses. Touch drag and tap are supported.","游戏平台","浏览器","指南形式","prompt","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[131],{"_62":132,"_25":82,"_105":-7},"阅读作者最初的要求","研究这个工作流","ordered",true,[137,138,139,140],"Play a stage and compare paddle control, collision behavior, power-ups and losing a life.","Read the creator’s original Swedish request and AI attribution.","Open index.html locally and trace the game loop, level data and procedural graphics in game.js.","Ask an agent to change one brick pattern or power-up, then test launching, losing a life and restarting.","AI 工作流与开发背景","作者在瑞典语 README 中明确表示，代码、画面、音效、音乐与关卡由 Claude Code 配合 Claude Opus 5.5 完成，并公开最初的一句话要求。这是作者的开发说明，不是独立审核过的完整生成记录。","aiUse","guidance","创作方式","AI 生成（创作者归属）","category","provenance","方向","2D","track","metadata","引擎","Custom Canvas 2D · JavaScript · Web Audio","engine","lead","2d","ai-generated",[137,138,139,140],{"_62":170,"_25":82,"_17":127},{"_62":121,"_25":122,"_17":116,"_105":123},{"_62":167,"_25":113,"_168":169,"_105":114},{"_62":166,"_25":82,"_105":106},[165],"claude-code","Read the creator’s Claude Code attribution","Open the complete browser game","scope","complete-project","Read the creator’s original request",{"_172":173},"documents",{"_74":174,"_35":175},[177,181,182,183,180,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,179,216,178,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234,235,236,237],[176,177,178,179,180],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalo